R3474 frontdoor frame-semantics evidence
===== leg 1: read-only probe BEFORE the edit (tmp/probe-R3474.py, shipped Handler on an ephemeral port)
frame fields measured on the door as R3473 left it:
  GET  /preview/index.html                      -> 200 len 55185, ETag "f2f5718368674748"
  HEAD /preview/index.html                      -> 200 len 55185, empty body (matches GET)
  GET  + If-None-Match (the ETag above)          -> 304 len 0  <-- a 200 of 55185 bytes stands behind it
  HEAD + Range: bytes=0-9                       -> 206 len 10, Content-Range bytes 0-9/55185
  GET  + Range: bytes=0-9                       -> 206 len 10, Content-Range bytes 0-9/55185
  HEAD + Range + Accept-Encoding: gzip          -> 206 len 10, no Content-Encoding
  GET  + Accept-Encoding: gzip                  -> 200 len 15051, Content-Encoding gzip
  HEAD + Accept-Encoding: gzip                  -> 200 len 15051, Content-Encoding gzip
  GET  /            + If-None-Match (its ETag)  -> 200 len 207340 (validator never read)
  GET  /healthz     + If-None-Match (its ETag)  -> 200 len 2      (validator never read)
  GET  / twice                                  -> ETag "1b0cb81b71953e22" then "ad0fabd69db6767d"
                                                   (the root body is rebuilt per request)
